# Based on GitHub's gitignore templates (Gradle, Java, Kotlin, JetBrains,
# VisualStudioCode, Eclipse, macOS, Windows, Linux).

### Local-only documentation ###
# Notes, drafts and research that stay on this machine and are never committed.
/local-docs/

### Local-only sample inputs ###
# Real PDFs used for manual testing. Books may be copyrighted, so never commit them.
/local-samples/

### Secrets / local environment ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

### Gradle ###
.gradle/
**/build/
!src/**/build/
gradle-app.setting
.gradletasknamecache
local.properties

### Kotlin ###
.kotlin/

### Java / JVM ###
*.class
*.log
*.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.nar
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

### IntelliJ IDEA / Android Studio ###
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
out/

### VS Code ###
# Shared launch/task configs and extension recommendations may be committed.
# settings.json stays ignored: it tends to hold machine-specific JDK paths.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace
.history/

### Eclipse (also generated by the VS Code Java extension) ###
bin/
.project
.classpath
.settings/
.factorypath
.apt_generated/

### Claude Code ###
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

### Temp files ###
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp

### macOS ###
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

### Windows ###
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

### Linux ###
*~
.directory
